[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; Dust drifting in a wall torch's light on a cutscene set: a dozen specks wander slowly through a
; box in front of the flame and fade in and out. The set adds one to each torch, in the torch's
; frame (+z out from the wall). Speck colour #FFD08A, the torch light's warmth, at 60% alpha.

